{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1423671-overlapping-competing-influences-well-positioned-sleepers","id":1423671,"title":"Overlapping, Competing Influences, well positioned Sleepers","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Mage: The Ascension"],"posts":[{"date":"2020-11-13T20:42:36-08:00","id":1423671,"title":"Overlapping, Competing Influences, well positioned Sleepers","content":"(Question at End)<br /> <br /> I envision a special class of Sleeper NPC, similar to Acolytes and ECs, except that they are not in direct contact with any Mage who intends to take them under their wing. They are within the range of two or more different Magickal Effects that influence the population, created by Mages of different factions. The effects are not targeted at any particular person, in the same way that a billboard advertising perfume wasn't targeted at a consumer identified by name. So, for an example, there are two strongholds from each Earthly Mage faction in a city. Each has a Node of 3.<br /> <br /> The first is an Iteration X Construct that uses brain-machine interface helmets to treat addiction and mental illness. It compiles patients' brain-data with the goal of improving the services it offers. It uses real, televised testimonial ads infused with Mind Magick to spread the good news about breakthroughs in cybernetic medicine. The ads are aired on local stations. The Construct's resonance overlaps that of the second stronghold. <br /> <br /> The second is a Celestial Chorus run Privacy Rights NGO, built on the plateau of a hill. It has religious architecture. It communicates through word of mouth and offers free tests to identify aps on people's phones that film or take pictures without consent. Withdrawal from consumer culture, reclamation of personal dignity and a return to spirituality are the messages it promotes. It uses Prime, Forces and Mind to draw people's attention to the building itself and affect onlookers on an unconscious level by transmitting its resonance through sight. <br /> <br /> Bex Belyr, a Sleeper, lives equidistant from both Nodes. She doesn't know any Mages, has never been to either place, but she is being influenced by the competing Magicks of both. She processes the messages, partly unconsciously and partly consciously, arriving at a philosophical epiphany unique to her. She shares her insight and quickly draws a retinue of believers willing to advance her ideas. They become a Sleeper-lead faction who unknowingly benefit from the combined energies of local Awakened rivals.<br /> <br /> Questions:<br /> <br /> How common would NPCs like Bex be, considering overlapping zones of influence?<br /> <br /> Could they rival Mages with a paradigm of their own?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Thank you for passing time with me in conversation. <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1480242-horizon-s-wild-and-crazy-homebrew-rules-and-metaplot-choices\" target=\"_blank\">My Hacks</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26467-horizonparty2021","name":"HorizonParty2021","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26467_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2020"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"610"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-11-14T14:44:36-08:00","id":1423836,"title":"","content":"I definitely think it\u2019s an interesting concept and a neat lenses to observe how cultural impacts might mingle and syncretize as well as show how blurry reality zones and competing influences can become.<br /> <br /> I don\u2019t know how populous I\u2019d make figures like this as a hard and fast rule. This sounds like the sort of figure that had the potential to develop into a Sleepwalker (linear magician) or Awakened already, but has been influenced in the development of their paradigm but environmental factors. I\u2019d say people like this are relatively common in their environments in that communities will generate a handful of leaders (or more depending on the size) naturally.<br /> <br /> How much they could rival the Awakened depends on your metric imo. Unless they Awaken they couldn\u2019t really challenge any Awakened as far as Magick is concerned but they could potentially rival them in other ways. They could develop significant linear magic, they could amass material resources and influence, they could become a counteracting cultural force within the environment which the Awakened would have to address to continue the development of their own paradigm and influence.<br /> <br /> There\u2019s a lot of variables but an interesting story there non the less.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11637-gryffon15","name":"Gryffon15","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11637_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"900"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-11-15T20:10:34-08:00","id":1424151,"title":"","content":"There are also insane politicians who got that way because two factions are trying to influence them.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Thank you for passing time with me in conversation. <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1480242-horizon-s-wild-and-crazy-homebrew-rules-and-metaplot-choices\" target=\"_blank\">My Hacks</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions"